{%- comment -%}
  icon-stopwatch — the filled stopwatch of the delivery countdown (the kit
  page's buy box): top button, side button, dial and a hand at twelve, in
  the highlight colour. Output stays on one line. Size via `classes`.
  Params:
    classes — sizing/layout classes. Default 'size-4 shrink-0'.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign stopwatch_classes = classes | default: 'size-4 shrink-0' -%}
